<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ ADRs mixed in N.Y. as Dow up nearly 50 points.</title>
<headline>NZ ADRs mixed in N.Y. as Dow up nearly 50 points.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs were mixed in late New York trade against a Dow which was up 48.72 points at 6,574.79 at 7.50 a.m. NZT.</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S., Britain and Australia.</p>
<p>Company     Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>Tranz Rail     N.Y.    US$18 1/2	 +0 3/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$28 5/8	 -1     *</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$27	     -0 3/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Paper	 N.Y.    US$19 3/4	 +0 1/4 *</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$12 1/2	 -0 1/4 *</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.    US$72 5/8	 +0 1/4 *</p>
<p>Thistle	  London  184		 -1</p>
<p>Guinness Peat  London  35 1/2	    -0 1/2</p>
<p>NZ IT	    London  237 1/2	   nil</p>
<p>Foreign &amp; Col London  150 1/2	   nil</p>
<p>Templeton	London  142 1/2	   +0 1/2</p>
<p>Lion	    Sydney  A$3.02	    -0.02</p>
<p>Goodman	 Sydney  A$1.66	    nil</p>
<p>Macraes	 Sydney  A$2.36	    +0.06</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of eight shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>* Denotes still trading.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
